{"seq":2,"slug":"black-holes-accretion","title":"黑洞与吸积盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/black-holes-accretion","wordCount":1267,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"黑洞与吸积盘\">黑洞与吸积盘</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当<a href=\"neutron-stars-pulsars\">中子星与脉冲星</a>中讨论的简并压再也撑不住引力，天体坍缩成黑洞——一个连光都无法逃逸的时空区域。黑洞本身不发光，但落向它的物质在掉入前会因角动量盘旋成一个炽热的吸积盘，把高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> 静质量能转化为辐射，效率远超核聚变。这使吸积黑洞成为宇宙中最高效的引擎，从恒星级黑洞双星到超大质量黑洞驱动的活动星系核，都靠这套机制发光。</p>\n<p>黑洞物理把本 hub 的几条主线汇聚于一处：吸积盘的热辐射对应<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/bremsstrahlung-thermal\">韧致辐射与热辐射</a>中的多温黑体，喷流的非热辐射对应<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton\">同步辐射与逆康普顿</a>，喷流中粒子的能量来自<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>，而双黑洞并合则是<a href=\"../multi-messenger/gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>迄今最丰产的信号源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[物质落向黑洞] --&gt; B[角动量守恒形成吸积盘]&#10;  B --&gt; C{吸积率}&#10;  C --&gt;|高吸积率| D[标准薄盘&lt;br/&gt;多温黑体热辐射]&#10;  C --&gt;|低吸积率| E[径移主导吸积流 ADAF&lt;br/&gt;高温低密]&#10;  B --&gt; F[热电子冕&lt;br/&gt;康普顿化硬X射线]&#10;  B --&gt; G[相对论喷流&lt;br/&gt;同步+逆康普顿]&#10;  A --&gt; H[事件视界&lt;br/&gt;R_s = 2GM/c^2]&#10;  H --&gt; I[阴影成像 EHT]&#10;  G --&gt; J[喷流粒子加速]\">flowchart TD\n  A[物质落向黑洞] --&gt; B[角动量守恒形成吸积盘]\n  B --&gt; C{吸积率}\n  C --&gt;|高吸积率| D[标准薄盘&lt;br/&gt;多温黑体热辐射]\n  C --&gt;|低吸积率| E[径移主导吸积流 ADAF&lt;br/&gt;高温低密]\n  B --&gt; F[热电子冕&lt;br/&gt;康普顿化硬X射线]\n  B --&gt; G[相对论喷流&lt;br/&gt;同步+逆康普顿]\n  A --&gt; H[事件视界&lt;br/&gt;R_s = 2GM/c^2]\n  H --&gt; I[阴影成像 EHT]\n  G --&gt; J[喷流粒子加速]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参量</th>\n<th>恒星级黑洞</th>\n<th>超大质量黑洞</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\,M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{10}\\,M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0224em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盘内温度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> K（软X射线）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> K（紫外）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型系统</td>\n<td>X 射线双星</td>\n<td>活动星系核/类星体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力波</td>\n<td>LIGO 频段并合</td>\n<td>脉冲星计时阵 / LISA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时空结构与关键半径\">时空结构与关键半径</h2><p>黑洞由质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、自旋 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 两个参量完全描述（电荷天体物理上可忽略）。最基本的尺度是史瓦西半径</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_s = \\frac{2GM}{c^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对太阳质量约 3 公里。对吸积而言更重要的是最内稳定圆轨道（ISCO）：盘物质只能稳定盘旋到 ISCO，再往内便迅速落入视界。ISCO 半径随自旋变化——无自旋黑洞 ISCO 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3R_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，极端自旋（顺行）则缩到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5R_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。因此 ISCO 越小、盘越靠内、内温越高，自旋就编码在最内盘的辐射里。</p>\n<p>测自旋有两种主流方法：连续谱拟合法用<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/bremsstrahlung-thermal\">韧致辐射与热辐射</a>所述多温黑体谱的内边界定位 ISCO；铁 K<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 谱线法则利用 6.4 keV 荧光线被强引力红移和多普勒效应展宽的轮廓反推内盘半径。事件视界望远镜（EHT）2019 年起对 M87* 和银心 Sgr A* 的&quot;阴影&quot;直接成像，则把视界尺度的时空结构变成了可观测图像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"吸积模式与谱态\">吸积模式与谱态</h2><p>吸积盘的辐射形态强烈依赖吸积率。高吸积率下形成标准薄盘（Shakura-Sunyaev 模型），几何薄、光学厚、辐射高效，给出软X射线的多温黑体谱。低吸积率下气体来不及辐射冷却，演化成径移主导吸积流（ADAF）：几何厚、光学薄、高温低密，大部分能量随物质带入视界，整体黯淡。Sgr A* 的极低光度正是 ADAF 的典型。</p>\n<p>恒星级黑洞双星在爆发期会在不同谱态间切换，形成著名的&quot;q 字形&quot;光度-硬度演化轨迹：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>谱态</th>\n<th>主导成分</th>\n<th>物理图像</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>软态（高态）</td>\n<td>多温黑体盘</td>\n<td>标准薄盘伸至 ISCO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬态（低态）</td>\n<td>幂律 + 高能截断</td>\n<td>热康普顿冕主导，常伴喷流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间态</td>\n<td>盘 + 冕混合</td>\n<td>态转换，喷流可被抛射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>硬态中的幂律成分由盘外的热电子冕对盘软光子做逆康普顿散射（康普顿化）产生，这是<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton\">同步辐射与逆康普顿</a>逆康普顿过程在吸积系统中的具体体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"喷流与活动星系核\">喷流与活动星系核</h2><p>约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> 的吸积黑洞会沿自转轴喷出相对论性喷流，可延伸至宿主星系之外。喷流的能量提取机制尚有争议，主流是布兰福德-兹纳耶克过程：旋转黑洞通过贯穿视界的磁场把自旋能抽出。喷流中的粒子经<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>（激波与磁重联）加速，辐射出从射电到 TeV 的非热宽频谱。</p>\n<p>当喷流恰好朝向地球，相对论性增亮使其成为耀变体——活动星系核里最极端的一类。耀变体的双峰能谱（同步峰 + 逆康普顿峰）是 SSC 与外康普顿模型的检验场，其 TeV 耀发也使它成为<a href=\"../multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>的候选源：2017 年 IceCube 在耀变体 TXS 0506+056 方向探测到高能中微子，与伽马耀发时间吻合，是多信使天文学的里程碑。下游<a href=\"../multi-messenger/cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>的最高能段也被认为可能来自此类喷流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>黑洞由质量与自旋描述，吸积盘以高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> 的效率把引力能转为辐射，是宇宙最高效的引擎，并承接<a href=\"neutron-stars-pulsars\">中子星与脉冲星</a>坍缩的终点。</li>\n<li>ISCO 半径随自旋收缩，自旋通过连续谱拟合与铁线轮廓两种方法测出；EHT 已对视界阴影直接成像。</li>\n<li>吸积模式分高效薄盘与黯淡 ADAF；恒星级黑洞双星在软/硬谱态间切换，硬态幂律来自热康普顿化。</li>\n<li>喷流靠布兰福德-兹纳耶克过程从黑洞自旋取能，喷流粒子经<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>加速，辐射非热宽频谱。</li>\n<li>耀变体把黑洞物理与<a href=\"../multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>、<a href=\"../multi-messenger/cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>连成多信使网络，双黑洞并合则是<a href=\"../multi-messenger/gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>最丰产的信号源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"黑洞与吸积盘","id":"黑洞与吸积盘"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时空结构与关键半径","id":"时空结构与关键半径"},{"level":2,"text":"吸积模式与谱态","id":"吸积模式与谱态"},{"level":2,"text":"喷流与活动星系核","id":"喷流与活动星系核"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"中子星与脉冲星","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/neutron-stars-pulsars"},"next":{"title":"伽马射线暴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts"}}